-- PROVISIONAL R-Q4: `WHO` is the filter word and `WHERE` is not overloaded, so
-- a WHERE block after a quantified obligation still means local definitions.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`sign by the due date` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN due
    WHERE
        due MEANS 14
